<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Patch>

	<!--
		With Shambler Variants (dorbo.shamblervariants): ordinary shamblers no longer rise as the xenotypes that mod uses.
		That mod turns each of them into a special variant (Dirtmole burrowers, Genie and Highmate cantors, Impid bursters,
		Neanderthal and Hussar thrashers, Sanguophage latchers, Starjack gloams, Waster and Yttakin tanglers, Pigskin
		pallbearers), so a plain shambler of the same xenotype would blur the theme. The same goes for the modded xenotypes it
		uses and this mod also lists: Stoneborn (burrower), Avaloi (cantor), Brawnum, Saurid and Keshig (thrasher), Geist,
		Venator and Half-foot (gloam), Insector and Buzzer (tangler). Baseliner stays; the removed weight (0.31) falls back
		to baseliners.
		This folder loads only when Shambler Variants is active, and is listed before 1.6 in loadFolders.xml so it runs
		after the patch that creates the list (RimWorld applies the last-listed folder first).
		Ghosts (Cybranian - Anomaly Ghosts) are not touched.
	-->
	<Operation Class="PatchOperationRemove">
		<xpath>Defs/PawnKindDef[@Name="ShamblerBase"]/xenotypeSet/xenotypeChances/*[self::Dirtmole or self::Genie or self::Impid or self::Neanderthal or self::Hussar or self::Starjack or self::Waster or self::Yttakin or self::Pigskin or self::Stoneborn or self::DV_Avaloi or self::DV_Brawnum or self::VRESaurids_Saurid or self::DV_Keshig or self::GS_Geist or self::DV_Venator or self::DV_Halffoot or self::VRE_Insector or self::DV_Buzzer]</xpath>
	</Operation>

</Patch>
